# LinkedIn capture set. The repo is PUBLIC and these are shots of a SIGNED-IN
# session: one frame has the owner's email address in clear text, another has
# his profile, and the list frames show which postings he has applied to. That
# is the same thing backups/ is excluded to protect. The seven older
# screenshots/*.png are signed-out views of public postings and stay tracked.
screenshots/linkedin-*/

